+## Explicit public-root verifier candidate
+
+This isolated copy adds one real read-only command: `sovos-l0 verify-public-root`.
+It fetches the public apex root, Hugging Face mirror and board DID; then checks
+exact bytes, the ordered listed-leaf Merkle commitment and Ed25519 signature.
+The three public sources are fixed by the command, so a caller cannot redirect
+the DID lookup to an arbitrary signing key. The output reports each check
+separately and includes the source-fetch errors when a source is unavailable.
+`sovos-l0 verify-public-root --selftest` exercises valid and tampered fixtures
+without network access. Its exit code is 0 only for three VALID checks; code 2
+means INVALID or UNCHECKABLE. No private key, stamp, transaction or write is
+used. OTS/Rekor, leaf truth and estate coverage remain explicitly unassessed.
+
+This is an isolated review copy, not installed in the shared SOVOS package,
+not wired to MCP/A2A/HTTP and not deployed to Council OS. The inherited
+protocol names in `packs.v1.json` still describe a planning surface, not
+working network services.
